# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of checkout platform.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: docker-entrypoint.sh and the Dockerfile are
# executed inside a Linux container. If they are ever checked out with CRLF (the
# Windows default), the container fails at startup with the notoriously opaque
# "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M". Forcing LF here means a clone on any OS still
# produces a working image.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
